{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>「玉女掌門人」周慧敏（Vivian）日前59歲生日，她在社交平台分享自拍照，並與昔日寶麗金好友湯寶如及黎瑞恩驚喜飯敘，難得聚首掀起網民集體回憶，同場還有邵美琪和製作人伍健雄，伍健雄也在社交平台分享與壽星女合照，湯寶如在社交平台送祝福：\"Happy birthday V #happygathering\"，周慧敏也開心回應：\"Thank you Karen , love you all\"﹗</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:08.989636+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:36:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:45.049007+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:44.894306+00:00","content_hash":"e741963c32c582c6bfec53842e5def5aedc0d759fb4dfdbfc001c6714b3906b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}